{"ok":true,"data":{"items":[{"version":"0.12.1","channel":"beta","platform":"windows-x64","release_notes":"\n1.修复 Windows 增量更新的管理员授权与应用退出交接，避免同一更新被重复发起；取消或拒绝授权后，工程仍可继续使用。\n\n注：如果你在 0.12.0 应用内升级时遇到 Windows 安全提示反复弹出、一直停留在“正在退出工程”或无法完成升级，请先保存工程并退出 RoleAI Studio，然后从官网下载 0.12.1 完整安装包进行覆盖安装。覆盖安装不会主动删除已有工程。","full_package_size":114551433,"full_package_sha256":"6c1ceb7e9633a2cd2955ae8c90b2d03d234d4174a5fac16758ee597a56ad4704","published_at":"2026-09-23 20:05:17","installer_available":true,"update_eligible":false},{"version":"0.12.0","channel":"beta","platform":"windows-x64","release_notes":"\n1.控制台通道布局更紧凑，输入输出及插入发送操作更清晰；\n2.原厂与提供可信接口的第三方动态效果器显示真实增益衰减；\n3.修复 MIDI 录制预览、钢琴卷帘编辑与预听问题，并改进插件与工程稳定性。","full_package_size":114539021,"full_package_sha256":"1bd533a496b46fb2a27eb00f5061d918435fc7782973d0b7efef9e133fb184a8","published_at":"2026-09-22 22:36:25","installer_available":true,"update_eligible":false},{"version":"0.11.0","channel":"beta","platform":"windows-x64","release_notes":"\n1.新增星辉鼓组、暮星钢琴、夜弦电吉他、深潮电贝司、晨弦原声吉他、星脉打击乐、星风管乐和专业合成器八套独立音源内容；\n2.完善演奏映射、MCP作曲混音操作与按需读取的音乐技能。\n3.修复侧链动态效果器首次离线导出失败及取消后残留旁路问题，改善插件异步加载撤销、钢琴卷帘撤销刷新、循环选择取消与菜单管理。","full_package_size":114514604,"full_package_sha256":"4c8b7566279468f9f2beac813623317e4b0b468e5ae9d8b088fd94e951acaa24","published_at":"2026-09-16 00:04:57","installer_available":true,"update_eligible":false},{"version":"0.10.8","channel":"beta","platform":"windows-x64","release_notes":"\n新增分组总线快速创建与批量路由，修复轨道头和时间线网格错位，并支持分组总线插件前、插件后及推子后回录。","full_package_size":78689575,"full_package_sha256":"c2fdcc8064ebd74c98ed0f9ccd3898785d8aeb424e5066ffcc01fb6f8ea6a962","published_at":"2026-09-01 13:13:37","installer_available":true,"update_eligible":false},{"version":"0.10.7","channel":"beta","platform":"windows-x64","release_notes":"\n1.全面升级插件内容与音源语义；\n2.新增32频段动态EQ，完善片段编辑、时间线、控制台及插件编辑器；\n3.提升Kontakt加载、工程恢复和MCP编曲可靠性。","full_package_size":78669186,"full_package_sha256":"06cf21139223925559535ef16da3cbc7954e867fc4f06e27e1bb5c7e54b44f19","published_at":"2026-08-31 21:20:29","installer_available":true,"update_eligible":false},{"version":"0.10.6","channel":"beta","platform":"windows-x64","release_notes":"\n1.新增MCP对插件内容元数据识别与 Kontakt 内容装载支持，\n2.增强工程插件恢复可靠性；\n3.修复桌面端重做快捷键和退出卡顿反馈，","full_package_size":77881081,"full_package_sha256":"e56f85c56175885db1ed4b7da49561c6c9948ad505d773901db3acf514058d27","published_at":"2026-08-27 13:08:07","installer_available":true,"update_eligible":false},{"version":"0.10.5","channel":"beta","platform":"windows-x64","release_notes":"\n1.完善 MCP 编曲、混音和插件控制闭环。\n2.完善多声道导出能力。\n3.优化钢琴卷帘窗与导演台的已知问题。\n3.优化其他交互与已知问题","full_package_size":77808995,"full_package_sha256":"48171e0c7321cae9acaea428f4ce6496efd4a388fdcbfda4401a0d00a02c5d00","published_at":"2026-08-24 19:42:43","installer_available":true,"update_eligible":false},{"version":"0.10.4","channel":"beta","platform":"windows-x64","release_notes":"\n1. 修复导演台删除角色后剧本台角色列表未同步的问题，并新增生成任务取消功能。\n2. 优化钢琴卷帘窗拍号、吸附、横向缩放、播放头同步及音源触发反馈。\n3. 修复 CC、弯音、通道压力和单音压力的绘制、显示与无数据提示。","full_package_size":77517344,"full_package_sha256":"97407dfd56bee7f92f1f54b2557fd7d8924b5813bed67453e38e25a5f7b51a73","published_at":"2026-08-23 05:39:35","installer_available":true,"update_eligible":false},{"version":"0.10.3","channel":"beta","platform":"windows-x64","release_notes":"1. 修复大型模型下载到后续分片时出现网络错误或错误提示账户无权限的问题。\n2. 支持网络中断、短链过期、重新点击和软件重启后的断点续传。\n3. 下载会话最长保留24小时，刷新下载地址不再重复占用下载次数。\n4. 优化模型下载、完整包校验、解压安装和错误提示。","full_package_size":77495980,"full_package_sha256":"c4de2c7c8f5a8b2fd4f14ba056734464205068703bc6adcd14de8cecf16db9fe","published_at":"2026-08-20 02:19:09","installer_available":true,"update_eligible":false},{"version":"0.10.2","channel":"beta","platform":"windows-x64","release_notes":"1. IndexTTS 模型下载完成后显示分片校验和整包校验进度。\n2. 模型安装过程中显示每个分片及文件的解压安装进度。\n3. 解压时同步完成文件校验，减少重复读取和等待时间。","full_package_size":77493398,"full_package_sha256":"9b05628840eb6359c1d697cb5496ed2d42470052804a167f04004cdce6b59c77","published_at":"2026-08-19 22:46:45","installer_available":true,"update_eligible":false},{"version":"0.10.1","channel":"beta","platform":"windows-x64","release_notes":"1. 修复大型模型下载到约45%时可能因网络中断而失败的问题\n2. 支持模型分片断点续传和最多五次自动重试\n3. 下载过程中自动刷新临时授权地址\n4. 增加分片完整性校验和磁盘空间预检\n5. 优化网络中断、磁盘不足和完整性异常提示","full_package_size":77492879,"full_package_sha256":"c8fb794b7520c16d96f4ce09f0884d81793135bd779981befae463c0620de25c","published_at":"2026-08-19 20:59:59","installer_available":true,"update_eligible":false},{"version":"0.10.0","channel":"beta","platform":"windows-x64","release_notes":"1. 统一所有需要模型功能的下载提示和安装状态。\n2. 修复AI配音导演台缺少模型时误报组件不完整的问题。\n3. 模型安装完成后自动隐藏下载提示。","full_package_size":77482133,"full_package_sha256":"82c93595738a5dc388570ba64cdf95db5db8cd4683994ff22e8d45b934d12fe2","published_at":"2026-08-19 20:00:06","installer_available":true,"update_eligible":false},{"version":"0.9.9","channel":"beta","platform":"windows-x64","release_notes":"1.新增AI配音导演他功能\n2.新增AI分轨功能\n3.新增音频转MIDI功能\n4.优化交互与已知问题","full_package_size":77482508,"full_package_sha256":"6ff895624b7215ebe5e20fc4de4ce0031772afd318e8968755baf0c9f8f5e6b4","published_at":"2026-08-19 17:50:14","installer_available":true,"update_eligible":false},{"version":"0.9.8","channel":"beta","platform":"macos-universal2","release_notes":"1.升级 RVC 推理运行资源及独立训练组件\n2.增强模型交付与安装可靠性。\n3.修复其他已知问题","full_package_size":93861263,"full_package_sha256":"7a1102400d73faf6bbe2256b09109b3f6cec94053f59326ffa2559c2464ba6e2","published_at":"2026-08-10 11:45:27","installer_available":true,"update_eligible":false},{"version":"0.9.8","channel":"beta","platform":"windows-x64","release_notes":"1.升级 RVC 推理运行资源及独立训练组件\n2.增强模型交付与安装可靠性。\n3.修复其他已知问题","full_package_size":76881753,"full_package_sha256":"856ec9ef6cb83fa15113eb99acb5c590191c0251f7252c96d82a727bf53e4200","published_at":"2026-08-08 21:51:30","installer_available":true,"update_eligible":false},{"version":"0.9.7","channel":"beta","platform":"macos-universal2","release_notes":"1. 新增可视化更新进度，更新下载、安装及重启过程更加清晰可靠。\n2. 优化应用启动速度，双击图标后优先显示启动页面，并在后台继续加载。\n3. 支持将插槽中的插件拖动到任意轨道插槽。","full_package_size":93742132,"full_package_sha256":"990e92b03d5f9c5193d93ea20827bc4cee53e8433c69bb7fe421d352a50d10a8","published_at":"2026-08-03 18:34:14","installer_available":true,"update_eligible":false},{"version":"0.9.7","channel":"beta","platform":"windows-x64","release_notes":"RoleAI Studio 0.9.7 Beta\n\n本次更新重点提升 Windows 安装、RVC 训练、自动更新和编辑工作流的可靠性。\n\n主要改进：\n1. 训练插件增加安装、升级和卸载前的训练服务检测与安全关闭机制。\n2. 修复训练完成后模型、索引文件和 ONNX/C++ 格式产物未正确生成的问题。\n3. 改进中文路径及 Unicode 文件名下的训练、索引构建、模型保存和结果发布。\n4. 改进自动更新的文件占用处理、失败回滚和旧版本安全恢复。\n5. 优化轨道、时间线、插件槽、管理页面以及官网相关交互体验。\n\n升级说明：\n- 0.9.6 用户可以通过增量更新升级至 0.9.7。\n- 无法使用增量更新时，请下载完整安装包覆盖安装。\n- RVC Training Plugin 0.1.4 需要 RoleAI Studio 0.9.7 或更高版本。\n- Public Beta 安装包暂未使用受信任的 Authenticode 证书，Windows 可能显示“未知发布者”。","full_package_size":76736913,"full_package_sha256":"8581529d7bcf9e2898ee391f54f4b701b1dfb32d994e11a8becbbfdc53e0e679","published_at":"2026-08-03 13:48:21","installer_available":true,"update_eligible":false}],"pagination":{"page":1,"page_size":20,"total":17}}}